# --- Credentials: never commit ---
.Renviron
.env
**/api_creds/
*creds*
*secret*
*token*

# --- Data ---
# Committed: the CSVs each project's scripts generate, so you can look at the
# numbers behind a chart, or run a plot script without waiting on a data pull.
# Everything else stays local -- no raw play-by-play, no spreadsheets.
*.csv
!*/*/data/*.csv
# gameprep caches its play profiles a level deeper, and they are what the
# dashboard reads. The 828 per-game files under data/tidy/<league>/games/
# stay out: 9MB of intermediates nothing in the repo consumes.
!05_gameprep/data/tidy/*/profiles/*.csv
# The card's phrase and label tables are configuration, not data. Every
# coaching point on a card comes from tactical_phrases.csv, so a clone
# without these renders no bullets at all.
!05_gameprep/consumers/gameprep_cards/config/*.csv
*.xlsx
# ...except a project's own finished workbook, which is a deliverable in its
# own right rather than an intermediate: the D3 dataset's whole point is the
# conditional formatting, and a .csv cannot carry it.
!*/*/outputs/*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.rds

# --- R ---
Rplots.pdf
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rapp.history
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# --- Python ---
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- macOS / Office ---
.DS_Store
~$*
